WEBVTT

00:33:59.625 --> 00:34:03.768
and as soon as they heard the gavel,
everyone just jumped up

00:34:03.792 --> 00:34:06.976
and screamed and yelled
and hugged each other

00:34:07.000 --> 00:34:09.934
and cried and applauded
and stomped their feet

00:34:09.958 --> 00:34:13.601
and, you know, it was just
a total ruckus of delight.

00:34:13.625 --> 00:34:16.417
(Upbeat music)

00:34:22.833 --> 00:34:26.726
AG: You might not be negotiating
major international treaties,

00:34:26.750 --> 00:34:30.893
but understanding other people's interests
is always a core skill.